  "name": "Instant Summons (Inscribe Mark)",
  "type": "action",
  "img": "icons/commodities/gems/gem-fragments-turquoise.webp",
  "system": {
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>You touch the sapphire used in the casting and an object weighing 10 pounds or less whose longest dimension is 6 feet or less. The spell leaves an Invisible mark on that object and invisibly inscribes the object's name on the sapphire. Each time you cast this spell, you must use a different sapphire.</p><p>Thereafter, you can take a Magic action to speak the object's name and crush the sapphire. The object instantly appears in your hand regardless of physical or planar distances, and the spell ends.</p><p>If another creature is holding or carrying the object, crushing the sapphire doesn't transport it, but instead you learn who that creature is and where that creature is currently located.</p><section id=\"secret-px4JJQv7QxLmPdka\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This spell's Limited Uses are configured to track the number of inscribed objects, with the \"Inscribe\" and \"Recall\" activities restoring and consuming uses as appropriate.</p></section>",
